  "checks": [
    "Selecting a page row opens that page",
    "Create project adds a project folder and opens its dashboard",
    "Choosing a project and protocol enables Start Experiment",
    "Start Experiment opens an unsaved page from the protocol",
    "Repeated parameter values appear as suggestions; sample fields never do",
    "Enter keeps a typed value; Tab accepts a suggested value",
    "Choosing a sample links it to the field",
    "Save notebook page stores the field values, notes, and a copy of the result file",
    "A new page saved directly is listed in its project as Executed",
    "A renamed title waits for Save",
    "Save stores the new page title",
    "Add Table inserts a table of the chosen size",
    "Clicking a cell and typing fills the table",
    "Add Column adds a column to the table",
    "The molarity table computes the missing value",
    "Save stores both tables with the page",
    "The buffer preparer calculates each amount",
    "Closing the calculator leaves its table on the page",
    "Save stores the buffer calculation with the page",
    "Add Sample creates the sample, links it to the page, and adds a note line",
    "Add gel opens Gel for the current page",
    "Apply page edit changes the page copy only",
    "A suggested page offers Take Into Plan",
    "Take Into Plan turns a suggested page into a planned page",
    "A planned page offers Executed",
    "Executed records the page as executed with a time"
  ]
